sentences.t:
hwīlum eft ongan eldo gebunden,
gomel gūðwiga gioguðe cwīðan,
hildestrengo;

Þā wæs eft hraðe
gearo gyrnwræce Grendeles mōdor,
sīðode sorhfull;

Wīf unhȳre
hyre bearn gewræc, beorn ācwealde
ellenlīce;

holm heolfre wēoll, ond ic hēafde becearf
in ðām [gūð]sele Grendeles mōdor
ēacnum ecgum;
